note: "One T1 edit (the ordering rule) and four T3 documents; no T2 change. The two T2 docs the plan expected to amend are listed under untouched with their reasoning, so the absence is a recorded decision rather than a silent omission. verify-doc green over the whole governed tree - 103 docs, 0 red. Epic distillation (T3 archiving, the flow spec/'s promotion to T1) remains owed at epic close."
